\f0\b0  I recovered \'93Elvi in pools\'94, but the progression matters:\uc0\u8232 \'93Elvi show up with guitars and end up in their swimming pools.\'94\uc0\u8232 It is the journey from musician/guest to pool occupant that carries the comic social collapse.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
