\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The UDF troops attending shows are more than another joke in the catalogue.
\f0\b0  Your thought was:\uc0\u8232 \'93Troops can be caught attending Elvi performance and be having a thoroughly good time.\'94\uc0\u8232 The useful word is 
