\f0\b0 . Their enjoyment exists slightly awkwardly relative to the military occupation. It is funny because there is enough institutional separation between what the UDF is doing and what some individual troops are doing for somebody to be caught doing it. I smoothed that into \'93soldiers attend performances\'94.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
