\f0\b0  Your instruction was:\uc0\u8232 \'93The draft MUST contain the humour we have already uncovered. Collect the humour points and potential prose that narrates them.\'94\uc0\u8232 That is stronger than \'93these are useful jokes\'94. It is a 
