\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 You then strengthened that into an additive revision rule.
\f0\b0  When asking for the redraft you said:\uc0\u8232 \'93It\'92s mostly additive. If I find you have added some good things and taken away others, I will reject the draft.\'94\uc0\u8232 I omitted this from the recovery. It matters enormously given what subsequently went wrong. The drafting process itself is supposed to preserve accumulated value. 
