\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The sideways-entry principle needs to remain concrete.
\f0\b0  The rejected:\uc0\u8232 \'93By breakfast, Sublime Point had acquired an army.\'94\uc0\u8232 failed because it 
\f1\b announced a situation
\f0\b0 . You had already established that your prose enters sideways. My later trapped-patrol opening was better, but even that is quarry rather than canon. The recovered rule is: enter through an event, predicament, character action or specific consequence that allows the larger state to emerge.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
