\f0\b0  I did mention this, but I underplayed how forcefully you corrected it. When I split the provisional block inside one of its existing paragraphs, you said I had:\uc0\u8232 \'93shredded that narrative into tiny pieces\'94\uc0\u8232 and\uc0\u8232 \'93sacrificed narrative flow for complete and slavish adherence to the timeline.\'94\uc0\u8232 Therefore a future braid must preserve 
